                <source>Edit the note and press Enter</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="context_reporter.editor.hint" resname="context_reporter.editor.hint">
                <source>Drag to draw. Click an annotation to select it, then drag to move it or press Delete to remove it. Double-click a note to edit it. Redact paints an opaque black box into the image that is sent; only the areas you cover are redacted.</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="context_reporter.sensitive.title" resname="context_reporter.sensitive.title">
                <source>Check for sensitive information before sending</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="context_reporter.sensitive.secrets" resname="context_reporter.sensitive.secrets">
                <source>Do not include passwords, API keys, access tokens, private keys, recovery codes or other secrets in the report or screenshot. Remove the screenshot or cover sensitive information before you send the report.</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="context_reporter.sensitive.context" resname="context_reporter.sensitive.context">
                <source>Depending on the privacy settings of your administrator, the report also contains technical context such as URLs, record identifiers, your username, browser and environment data and Findings. The technical data below shows what is sent.</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="context_reporter.technical.summary" resname="context_reporter.technical.summary">
                <source>Review the technical data that will be sent</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="context_reporter.technical.explanation" resname="context_reporter.technical.explanation">
                <source>This is exactly what will be stored and sent. The report ID, the time and the image data are added when you submit.</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="context_reporter.technical.assignedOnSubmit" resname="context_reporter.technical.assignedOnSubmit">
                <source>(assigned on submit)</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="context_reporter.technical.screenshotContent" resname="context_reporter.technical.screenshotContent">
                <source>(the edited image, added on submit)</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="context_reporter.destinations.send" resname="context_reporter.destinations.send">
                <source>The report will be saved in TYPO3 and sent via: %s.</source>
            </trans-unit>
